# sweet spot: cluster shapes stay clean, states ≥0.2% of cells stay
# visible, render is ~1 s. Users override with ?sample=N (up to 1e6),
# or effectively "all" by passing a value larger than the dataset.
# Does NOT apply to hexbin/violin/box/kde/bar/histogram/ecdf — those
# aggregate server-side and benefit from more cells, not fewer.
